{"id":"cb7ab804f482ad4e","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-turing-preorder.md","title":"Turing 归约的预序性质","display":"thm-turing-preorder — Turing 归约的预序性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-turing-preorder","aliases":["20-thm-turing-preorder"],"display":"thm-turing-preorder — Turing 归约的预序性质","chapter":"3","section":"3.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§3.2 的归约性质","source_pdf_pages":[90],"source_printed_pages":[54],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-turing-preorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-turing-preorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-turing-preorder — Turing 归约的预序性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§3.2 的归约性质"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\nA\\le_TA,\\qquad\n(A\\le_TB\\land B\\le_TC)\\Rightarrow A\\le_TC.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\nA\\le_TA,\\qquad\n(A\\le_TB\\land B\\le_TC)\\Rightarrow A\\le_TC.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自反性查询目标位。传递性在模拟第一层归约时，用第二层全归约回答每个有限 oracle 查询；每个被需要的答案都停止，故组合归约全定义。</p>\n<p>来源：§3.2 的归约性质；印刷页 54；PDF 第 90 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\nA\\le_TA,\\qquad\n(A\\le_TB\\land B\\le_TC)\\Rightarrow A\\le_TC.","display":true}],"bytes":996,"backlinks":[{"id":"c82e036702142487","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-turing-preorder]]。"}],"outgoing":["52376918bee1945e"]}